      <section id="implementacao">
        <h2>⚙️ Implementação Passo a Passo</h2>
        <p>Configuração técnica detalhada para múltiplos números WhatsApp.</p>

        <div class="implementation-steps">
          <div class="step-card">
            <h3>1️⃣ Docker Multi-Container Setup</h3>
            <p>Configure seu docker-compose.yml para múltiplas instâncias:</p>
            <pre><code class="language-yaml">version: '3.8'

services:
  evolution1:
    image: devlikeprod/evolution-api:latest
    container_name: whatsapp-1
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      - INSTANCE_NAME=evolution1
    volumes:
      - ./instances/evolution1:/evolution/instances/evolution1
    networks:
      - whatsapp-net

  evolution2:
    image: devlikeprod/evolution-api:latest
    container_name: whatsapp-2
    ports:
      - "8081:8080"
    environment:
      - INSTANCE_NAME=evolution2
    volumes:
      - ./instances/evolution2:/evolution/instances/evolution2
    networks:
      - whatsapp-net

networks:
  whatsapp-net:
    driver: bridge</code></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="step-card">
            <h3>2️⃣ Cloudflare Tunnel Configuration</h3>
            <p>Configure domínios dedicados para cada instância:</p>
            <pre><code class="language-toml">tunnel: whatsapp-multi
credentials-file: /root/.cloudflared/credentials.json

ingress:
  - hostname: api1.getnexo.com.br
    service: http://localhost:8080
  - hostname: api2.getnexo.com.br
    service: http://localhost:8081
  - hostname: api3.getnexo.com.br
    service: http://localhost:8082
  - service: http_status:404</code></pre>
          </div>

          <div class="step-card">
            <h3>3️⃣ Load Balancer com n8n</h3>
            <p>Configure workflows inteligentes de distribuição:</p>
